  <activityDataset>
    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="3e2cdb8f-018f-5309-bfb9-b11a3be67b4a" activityNameId="fd29abfc-0476-5834-9003-ba7893c2f1af" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Hard coal supply mix, at regional storage</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Hard coal supply mix, at regional storage
Update 2022 by ZHAW only updated domestic production shares and shares of imports, Remark: Average US coal quality (UHV=25.2MJ/kg). Dust from load/unload operations is included, as well as hard coal transport from mining to the power plant. Average coal losses are considered. Average emissions to groundwater due to leaching from coal heaps at storage at receiving terminal is estimated from the literature. NA; UUID: e5e6d166-d9c5-3b25-9db3-26611a4439cd
Included processes: Average US hard coal for domestic supply. The coal requirement includes the total losses from mining to the power plant. The dataset includes emissions to groundwater and particle emissions from the storage, coal loss during storage, energy demand for coal loading and unloading, land use, and hard coal transport from mining to the power plant.
Location: Geography: Average US conditions
Technology: Technology: Not specified
Time period: 
Production volume: 
Sampling: Sampling procedure: literature
Extrapolations: Extrapolations: see Geography/Text
Uncertainty adjustments: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_e5e6d166-d9c5-3b25-9db3-26611a4439cd.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
